us":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F2E678CB0906ABA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1910237023:1":{"text":"맛있겠다!","source_cn":"好、好想吃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x579F41BF1EF84F05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1910237024:1":{"text":"흠흠... 하이니? 방금 뭐라 한 게냐?","source_cn":"咳咳……海妮乖乖，你刚刚说什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F7F4955D4B8010D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1910237025:1":{"text":"아... 아무 말도 안 했어!","source_cn":"呃……我什么都没说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82ADB82EF7866D5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1910237026:1":{"text":"알았어, 알았으니까 꼬리 좀 그만 잡아당겨! 계속 이야기해 줄 테니까. 크흠, 지난번에 어디까지 얘기했더라?","source_cn":"行了行了，别扯咱的尾巴，咱就继续给你们讲故事。咳，上次...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EC032F17E5476A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1910237027:1":{"text":"하늘 얘기! 오빠가 그랬잖아. 오빠네 하늘이 우리한테는 바다 표면이라고. 그리고 하늘에는 동그랗고 뜨겁고 엄청 밝은 게 있는데... 그게 태, 태...","source_cn":"说到天空！你说，你们的天空就是我们的海面。天上，有个圆...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB5CD8860EA2365F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1910237028:1":{"text":"태양. 태양 말고도 밤에는 달이 뜨는데, 그것도 아주 밝게 빛나! 난 달이 좀 더 예쁜 것 같아.","source_cn":"太阳。除了太阳，在夜晚的时候还有一个月亮，也会发出很亮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4012E25C76D51FB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1910237029:1":{"text":"톨란 오빠, 태양은 대체 뭐야? 왜 그렇게 뜨거워? 해저 화산보다도 뜨거워?","source_cn":"图澜哥哥，太阳到底是什么？为什么会那么烫，比海底火山还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52B126C2E4FEA1CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1910237030:1":{"text":"태양이랑 달은 얼마나 밝아? 할머니가 가장 좋아하는 조개 진주보다도 밝아?","source_cn":"太阳和月亮到底有多亮？比阿嬷最喜欢的那颗蚌珠还亮吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13D9B2CD8A38FB4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1910237031:1":{"text":"우리는 왜 태양이랑 달을 볼 수 없어? 그건 바다를 떠나야만 보고 만질 수 있는 거야?","source_cn":"为什么我们看不到太阳和月亮呀？是不是只有离开海，才能看...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2F6FFBC79FB81EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1910237032:0":{"text":"바다를 떠난다고? 그건 너무 무섭잖아...","source_cn":"离开海？那也太可怕了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62772AC496408CCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1910237033:1":{"text":"바다를 떠나도 만질 수는 없어. 태양이랑 달은 하늘 아주아주 높은 곳에 떠 있거든.","source_cn":"离开海也摸不到，太阳和月亮都在天上很高很高的地方挂着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FC73525FCAF7CB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1910237034:0":{"text":"떠 있다고? 누가 그렇게 먼 곳에 걸어 놓은 거야? 오빠의 워터라이더라면 거기까지 갈 수 있지 않을까?","source_cn":"挂着？是谁把它们挂在那么远的地方？如果是哥哥的水行器，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA97EC961A9B63A6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1910237035:0":{"text":"...안 돼. 땅에서 하늘까지의 거리는 바다 표면에서 심해 바닥까지의 거리보다도 훨씬 멀거든.","source_cn":"……也不行。地面离天空比离深海的海底还远。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAD6412F1A2A4EA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1910237036:0":{"text":"정말? 그걸 어떻게 알아? 난 바다 밑바닥이 얼마나 깊은지도 모르는데!","source_cn":"真的吗，你怎么知道的？我都不知道海底有多深！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04796545B3BAFD43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1910237037:0":{"text":"허허... 바다에는 바닥이 있지만, 하늘에는 끝이 없단다.","source_cn":"呵呵……因为海是有底的，天空却是没有顶的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF5F1AC6DBCEA9E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1910237038:0":{"text":"언니, 언니는 심해 바닥까지 가 본 적 있어?","source_cn":"姐姐，你去过深海的海底吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EE594A96FA47E2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1910237039:1":{"text":"아니, 나도 거기서 모험하고 싶은 마음은 굴뚝같지만...","source_cn":"没有呢，虽然我的确很想去那里冒险，但——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2B97B78EB4ED81A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1910237040:1":{"text":"하지만 심해는 너무 위험해서 살아갈 수 없어. 우리가 있어야 할 곳은 가장 안전하고 아름다운 타라사야.","source_cn":"——但是深海对我们来说非常危险，我们是无法在那里生存的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7B061366590357E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1910237041:1":{"text":"자, 이야기 다 들었으면 다들 와서 후식으로 달콤한 해초를 먹으렴.","source_cn":"好了，故事听完了，大家来吃餐后甜藻吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13FF9C2939939F79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1910237042:1":{"text":"허허... 샤이야, 너 이거 좋아하지 않더냐? 무슨 생각을 하느라 그리 멍하니 있는 게야?","source_cn":"呵呵……小汐儿不是也爱吃这个吗？怎么发着呆，想什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42C55437C75C9E9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1910237043:0":{"text":"높이... 올라가서 하늘에 가고 싶어.","source_cn":"想，爬高……去天上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB935B69E2970B8B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1910237044:1":{"text":"바다 일족 아이는 톨란의 머리 위를 멍하니 바라보더니... 날렵하게 그 위로 기어올라갔다!","source_cn":"年幼的海裔呆呆地盯着图澜的头顶，然后……竟然灵活地爬了上去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27386F0CED245077","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1910237045:1":{"text":"워터라이더... 타는 거 같아.","source_cn":"像……骑水行器。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FA69EE9D916D472","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1910237046:1":{"text":"뭐? 야, 꼬맹아. 날 워터라이더처럼 타고 다니겠다고?","source_cn":"哈？小崽子，你把咱当成水行器骑？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA670E8A21BC5AFEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1910237047:1":{"text":"말은 그렇게 해도 톨란은 워터라이더인 척하며 바다 일족 아이를 등에 태우고 식탁 주위를 뛰어다니기 시작했다. 집 안에는 사람들의 웃음소리가 끊이지 않았다.","source_cn":"嘴上这么说着，但图澜却真的装作水行器，背上年幼的小海裔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79AC1E601D0660E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","docume